   "kicker": "A famous verse",
   "level": 0.2,
   "start": 1.7,
   "end": 10.92,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You've seen this one. On gym walls. On locker room doors.",
     "start": 2.6,
     "end": 6.52
    },
    {
     "text": "I can do all things through Christ who gives me strength.",
     "start": 7.14,
     "end": 10.02
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sounds",
   "kicker": "What it sounds like",
   "level": 0.35,
   "start": 10.12,
   "end": 18.1,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It sounds like a promise that you'll win.",
     "start": 11.02,
     "end": 12.7
    },
    {
     "text": "So here's the first rule of reading the Bible. Read the verse next door.",
     "start": 13.32,
     "end": 17.2
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "prison",
   "kicker": "Where Paul was",
   "level": 0.55,
   "start": 17.3,
   "end": 25.82,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Paul wrote this letter as a prisoner, in chains.",
     "start": 18.2,
     "end": 20.98
    },
    {
     "text": "And one sentence earlier, he tells you what all things means.",
     "start": 21.46,
     "end": 24.92
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "next-door",
   "kicker": "One sentence earlier",
   "level": 0.7,
   "start": 25.02,
   "end": 31.02,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Being filled and being hungry. Having plenty and having need.",
     "start": 25.92,
     "end": 30.12
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "means",
   "kicker": "What all things means",
   "level": 0.85,
   "start": 30.22,
   "end": 38.22,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "All things isn't winning. It's the full days and the hungry days. It's being all right when you lose.",
     "start": 31.12,
     "end": 37.32
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "better",
   "kicker": "A better promise",
   "level": 0.95,
   "start": 37.42,
   "end": 46.04,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "That's a better promise than the one on the wall. It doesn't say you'll get what you want.",
     "start": 38.32,
     "end": 42.6
    },
    {
     "text": "It says Christ will be enough when you don't.",
     "start": 43.08,
     "end": 45.14
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "close",
   "kicker": "",
